# "wedi" (past, after) counts UP from the hour just named:
# "chwarter wedi naw" is 09:15 and "hanner awr wedi tri" is 03:30 -- the
# English direction, NOT the Icelandic one that names the coming hour.
# Sources: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chwarter ("chwarter wedi naw" =
# quarter past nine); en.wikibooks.org, "Welsh/Mynediad/Lesson 8" (a full
# five-minute table, 2:30 = "hanner awr wedi dau").
wedi
